{"seq":2,"slug":"database-splitting","title":"数据库拆分与数据迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/database-splitting","wordCount":1767,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据库拆分与数据迁移\">数据库拆分与数据迁移</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据库拆分是微服务迁移的<strong>深水区</strong>：代码拆分只需重组模块边界，而数据库拆分要求把原本由数据库免费提供的能力——跨表 JOIN、ACID 事务、外键引用完整性、跨域报表——在应用层重新实现。其核心矛盾是<strong>数据所有权</strong>：当多个服务共享同一个数据库时，服务独立部署形同虚设，一次 Schema 变更仍要协调所有相关服务。因此拆分的终点是&quot;每个服务独占自己的数据存储&quot;，路径则是渐进的：先逻辑隔离（同实例分 Schema），再 API 化（服务间通过接口取数），最后物理分离。跨服务的查询与事务一致性则分别由 API 组合/CQRS 与 Saga 模式承接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据层解耦的核心挑战\">数据层解耦的核心挑战</h2><p>在微服务迁移中，代码拆分相对直接——重新组织模块边界、定义 API 接口、部署独立服务。但数据库拆分是真正的深水区。当多个服务共享同一个数据库时，表面上的服务独立部署毫无意义——一次 Schema 变更仍然需要协调所有相关服务，一个慢查询仍然会拖垮所有服务的性能。</p>\n<p>共享数据库模式（Shared Database）是&quot;分布式单体&quot;的核心症状：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 反模式 - 共享数据库&#10;        A[Order Service] --&gt; DB[(Shared DB)]&#10;        B[User Service] --&gt; DB&#10;        C[Inventory Service] --&gt; DB&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 目标 - 数据所有权明确&#10;        D[Order Service] --&gt; DB_O[(Order DB)]&#10;        E[User Service] --&gt; DB_U[(User DB)]&#10;        F[Inventory Service] --&gt; DB_I[(Inventory DB)]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 反模式 - 共享数据库\n        A[Order Service] --&gt; DB[(Shared DB)]\n        B[User Service] --&gt; DB\n        C[Inventory Service] --&gt; DB\n    end\n    subgraph 目标 - 数据所有权明确\n        D[Order Service] --&gt; DB_O[(Order DB)]\n        E[User Service] --&gt; DB_U[(User DB)]\n        F[Inventory Service] --&gt; DB_I[(Inventory DB)]\n    end</pre><p>数据库拆分的核心难点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>难点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>传统单体的解决方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跨表 JOIN</td>\n<td>订单需要关联用户和商品数据</td>\n<td>SQL JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务一致性</td>\n<td>下单同时扣库存</td>\n<td>ACID 事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用完整性</td>\n<td>外键约束保证数据一致</td>\n<td>数据库级外键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报表查询</td>\n<td>跨域聚合分析</td>\n<td>复杂 SQL + 视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据迁移</td>\n<td>Schema 变更全量影响</td>\n<td>统一 Migration</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>微服务架构中，这些能力都不再免费获得——需要在应用层重新实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式数据拆分路径\">渐进式数据拆分路径</h2><p>数据库拆分不应一步到位，而应遵循渐进式路径：</p>\n<h3 id=\"phase-1-schema-逻辑隔离\">Phase 1：Schema 逻辑隔离</h3><p>在同一个数据库实例中，按限界上下文划分 Schema 或表前缀。通过代码规范和 Review 机制强制执行访问规则——服务只能访问自己 Schema 下的表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 逻辑隔离：同一数据库，不同 Schema&#10;CREATE SCHEMA orders;&#10;CREATE SCHEMA users;&#10;CREATE SCHEMA inventory;&#10;&#10;-- Order Service 只访问 orders Schema&#10;CREATE TABLE orders.orders (...);&#10;CREATE TABLE orders.order_items (...);&#10;&#10;-- User Service 只访问 users Schema&#10;CREATE TABLE users.users (...);&#10;CREATE TABLE users.addresses (...);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 逻辑隔离：同一数据库，不同 Schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inventory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Order Service 只访问 orders Schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.orders (...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.order_items (...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- User Service 只访问 users Schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.users (...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.addresses (...);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优势</strong>：零迁移风险，通过静态分析工具检测跨 Schema 访问。</p>\n<p><strong>局限</strong>：仍然共享数据库连接池和 I/O 资源，无法独立扩缩。</p>\n<h3 id=\"phase-2-读写分离与-api-化\">Phase 2：读写分离与 API 化</h3><p>为每个限界上下文创建数据访问 API，其他服务不再直接查询其数据表，而是通过 API 获取数据：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant OS as Order Service&#10;    participant US as User Service&#10;    participant DB as Shared DB&#10;&#10;    Note over OS,DB: Phase 1: 直接查询&#10;    OS-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT * FROM users.users WHERE id = ?&#10;&#10;    Note over OS,US: Phase 2: 通过 API&#10;    OS-&gt;&gt;US: GET /internal/users/{id}&#10;    US-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT * FROM users.users WHERE id = ?&#10;    US-&gt;&gt;OS: User Response\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant OS as Order Service\n    participant US as User Service\n    participant DB as Shared DB\n\n    Note over OS,DB: Phase 1: 直接查询\n    OS-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT * FROM users.users WHERE id = ?\n\n    Note over OS,US: Phase 2: 通过 API\n    OS-&gt;&gt;US: GET /internal/users/{id}\n    US-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT * FROM users.users WHERE id = ?\n    US-&gt;&gt;OS: User Response</pre><h3 id=\"phase-3-物理数据库分离\">Phase 3：物理数据库分离</h3><p>当逻辑隔离和 API 化完成后，物理分离变成低风险操作——只需将表迁移到独立的数据库实例，更新连接字符串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据同步策略\">数据同步策略</h2><p>物理分离后，跨服务的数据需求通过以下策略满足：</p>\n<h3 id=\"change-data-capture-cdc\">Change Data Capture（CDC）</h3><p>CDC 通过监听数据库的变更日志（WAL/Binlog），将数据变更实时传播到其他服务。它不侵入业务代码，也不增加写入延迟。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Source&#10;        App[Order Service] --&gt; DB_S[(Order DB)]&#10;        DB_S --&gt; WAL[WAL/Binlog]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CDC Pipeline&#10;        WAL --&gt; Debezium[Debezium Connector]&#10;        Debezium --&gt; Kafka[Kafka Topic]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Consumers&#10;        Kafka --&gt; Analytics[Analytics Service]&#10;        Kafka --&gt; Search[Search Index]&#10;        Kafka --&gt; Replica[Read Replica]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Source\n        App[Order Service] --&gt; DB_S[(Order DB)]\n        DB_S --&gt; WAL[WAL/Binlog]\n    end\n    subgraph CDC Pipeline\n        WAL --&gt; Debezium[Debezium Connector]\n        Debezium --&gt; Kafka[Kafka Topic]\n    end\n    subgraph Consumers\n        Kafka --&gt; Analytics[Analytics Service]\n        Kafka --&gt; Search[Search Index]\n        Kafka --&gt; Replica[Read Replica]\n    end</pre><p>CDC 技术栈（2026 年主流）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Debezium</td>\n<td>开源、支持多数据库、Kafka 集成</td>\n<td>通用 CDC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS DMS</td>\n<td>托管服务、支持异构迁移</td>\n<td>AWS 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fivetran</td>\n<td>SaaS、零运维</td>\n<td>数据仓库同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PlanetScale CDC</td>\n<td>MySQL 专用、原生支持</td>\n<td>PlanetScale 用户</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"双写-dual-write\">双写（Dual Write）</h3><p>在迁移过渡期，应用同时写入新旧两个数据库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function createOrder(order: Order) {&#10;  // 写入旧数据库（主）&#10;  await legacyDb.orders.insert(order);&#10;&#10;  // 写入新数据库（副）&#10;  try {&#10;    await newOrderDb.orders.insert(transformOrder(order));&#10;  } catch (err) {&#10;    // 记录不一致，不阻塞主流程&#10;    await inconsistencyLog.record({&#10;      entity: &#39;order&#39;,&#10;      id: order.id,&#10;      error: err.message,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 写入旧数据库（主）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> legacyDb.orders.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 写入新数据库（副）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newOrderDb.orders.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transformOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 记录不一致，不阻塞主流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inconsistencyLog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      entity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      id: order.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      error: err.message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>双写的陷阱</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两次写入不在同一事务中，可能出现部分成功</li>\n<li>并发场景下顺序可能不一致</li>\n<li>长期双写消耗双倍写入资源</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>双写的安全实践</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>设定明确的双写期限（通常 2-4 周）</li>\n<li>定期运行一致性校验（Reconciliation Job）</li>\n<li>通过 Feature Flag 控制新数据库何时成为&quot;主&quot;</li>\n<li>双写期间只读新库用于验证，不将新库数据暴露给用户</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"事件溯源-event-sourcing\">事件溯源（Event Sourcing）</h3><p>对于需要完整历史记录的领域，事件溯源提供了一种天然支持数据迁移的架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Command[创建订单命令] --&gt; ES[Event Store]&#10;    ES --&gt; |OrderCreated| Proj1[订单视图投影]&#10;    ES --&gt; |OrderCreated| Proj2[统计投影]&#10;    ES --&gt; |OrderCreated| Proj3[搜索索引投影]\">graph LR\n    Command[创建订单命令] --&gt; ES[Event Store]\n    ES --&gt; |OrderCreated| Proj1[订单视图投影]\n    ES --&gt; |OrderCreated| Proj2[统计投影]\n    ES --&gt; |OrderCreated| Proj3[搜索索引投影]</pre><p>事件溯源将&quot;真相&quot;存储为不可变的事件流，多个消费者可以从同一事件流构建不同的物化视图。数据库迁移时，只需重放事件到新的数据存储即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"saga-模式-跨服务事务\">Saga 模式：跨服务事务</h2><p>数据库拆分后，跨服务的事务一致性通过 Saga 模式实现。Saga 将一个全局事务分解为一系列本地事务，每个本地事务完成后发布事件触发下一步，失败时执行补偿操作。</p>\n<p><strong>编排式 Saga（Orchestration）</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Orch as Saga Orchestrator&#10;    participant Order as Order Service&#10;    participant Payment as Payment Service&#10;    participant Inventory as Inventory Service&#10;&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Order: 创建订单(PENDING)&#10;    Order-&gt;&gt;Orch: 订单已创建&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Payment: 扣款&#10;    Payment-&gt;&gt;Orch: 扣款成功&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Inventory: 扣减库存&#10;    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Orch: 库存不足！&#10;    Note over Orch: 触发补偿&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Payment: 退款(补偿)&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Order: 取消订单(补偿)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Orch as Saga Orchestrator\n    participant Order as Order Service\n    participant Payment as Payment Service\n    participant Inventory as Inventory Service\n\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Order: 创建订单(PENDING)\n    Order-&gt;&gt;Orch: 订单已创建\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Payment: 扣款\n    Payment-&gt;&gt;Orch: 扣款成功\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Inventory: 扣减库存\n    Inventory-&gt;&gt;Orch: 库存不足！\n    Note over Orch: 触发补偿\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Payment: 退款(补偿)\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Order: 取消订单(补偿)</pre><p><strong>协同式 Saga（Choreography）</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Order Created Event] --&gt; B[Payment Service]&#10;    B --&gt; |Payment Completed| C[Inventory Service]&#10;    C --&gt; |Stock Reserved| D[Shipping Service]&#10;    C --&gt; |Stock Failed| E[Payment Service: Refund]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Order Service: Cancel]\">graph LR\n    A[Order Created Event] --&gt; B[Payment Service]\n    B --&gt; |Payment Completed| C[Inventory Service]\n    C --&gt; |Stock Reserved| D[Shipping Service]\n    C --&gt; |Stock Failed| E[Payment Service: Refund]\n    E --&gt; F[Order Service: Cancel]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>编排式</th>\n<th>协同式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>控制流</td>\n<td>集中（Orchestrator）</td>\n<td>分散（事件驱动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见性</td>\n<td>流程清晰可追踪</td>\n<td>需要额外工具追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耦合度</td>\n<td>Orchestrator 知道所有参与者</td>\n<td>服务间松耦合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>3-7 步骤的复杂流程</td>\n<td>2-3 步骤的简单流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障恢复</td>\n<td>Orchestrator 统一处理</td>\n<td>每个服务自行处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"跨服务查询的解决方案\">跨服务查询的解决方案</h2><p>数据库拆分后，原本的 SQL JOIN 不再可用。以下是替代方案：</p>\n<p><strong>API 组合（API Composition）</strong>：BFF 或 API Gateway 调用多个服务的查询接口，在应用层组合结果。</p>\n<p><strong>CQRS + 物化视图</strong>：为查询需求创建专门的读模型，通过 CDC 或事件同步数据：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph write[&quot;写侧 Commands&quot;]&#10;        OS[Order Service] --&gt; ODB[(Order DB)]&#10;        US[User Service] --&gt; UDB[(User DB)]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph stream[&quot;事件流&quot;]&#10;        ODB --&gt; CDC1[CDC]&#10;        UDB --&gt; CDC2[CDC]&#10;        CDC1 --&gt; Events[Event Stream]&#10;        CDC2 --&gt; Events&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph read[&quot;读侧 Queries&quot;]&#10;        Events --&gt; ReadDB[(Query Store)]&#10;        ReadDB --&gt; QueryAPI[Query Service]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph write[\"写侧 Commands\"]\n        OS[Order Service] --&gt; ODB[(Order DB)]\n        US[User Service] --&gt; UDB[(User DB)]\n    end\n    subgraph stream[\"事件流\"]\n        ODB --&gt; CDC1[CDC]\n        UDB --&gt; CDC2[CDC]\n        CDC1 --&gt; Events[Event Stream]\n        CDC2 --&gt; Events\n    end\n    subgraph read[\"读侧 Queries\"]\n        Events --&gt; ReadDB[(Query Store)]\n        ReadDB --&gt; QueryAPI[Query Service]\n    end</pre><p><strong>数据网格（Data Mesh）</strong>：每个领域团队除了提供操作 API 外，还负责发布其数据产品——标准化的、可供其他团队消费的数据集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据迁移的验证体系\">数据迁移的验证体系</h2><p>迁移正确性验证是整个流程中最不可省略的环节：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 一致性校验 Job - 定期对比新旧数据源&#10;async function reconciliationJob() {&#10;  const legacyOrders = await legacyDb.query(&#39;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE updated_at &gt; ?&#39;, [lastCheckpoint]);&#10;  const newOrders = await newOrderDb.query(&#39;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE updated_at &gt; ?&#39;, [lastCheckpoint]);&#10;&#10;  const discrepancies = findDiscrepancies(legacyOrders, newOrders);&#10;&#10;  if (discrepancies.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    await alerting.send({&#10;      severity: discrepancies.length &gt; 100 ? &#39;critical&#39; : &#39;warning&#39;,&#10;      message: `Data reconciliation found ${discrepancies.length} discrepancies`,&#10;      details: discrepancies.slice(0, 10),&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  metrics.gauge(&#39;reconciliation.discrepancy_count&#39;, discrepancies.length);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 一致性校验 Job - 定期对比新旧数据源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reconciliationJob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> legacyOrders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> legacyDb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM orders WHERE updated_at > ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [lastCheckpoint]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newOrders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newOrderDb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM orders WHERE updated_at > ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [lastCheckpoint]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> discrepancies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findDiscrepancies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(legacyOrders, newOrders);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (discrepancies.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alerting.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      severity: discrepancies.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'warning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Data reconciliation found ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">discrepancies</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} discrepancies`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      details: discrepancies.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gauge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reconciliation.discrepancy_count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, discrepancies.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>验证维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>行数对比</strong>：新旧数据源的记录总数是否匹配</li>\n<li><strong>内容校验</strong>：采样对比具体记录的字段值</li>\n<li><strong>时序一致</strong>：事件顺序是否正确</li>\n<li><strong>业务指标</strong>：核心业务指标（GMV、转化率）在迁移前后是否一致</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>数据库拆分是深水区</strong>：JOIN、ACID、外键、报表、全量迁移等单体免费能力需在应用层重建。</li>\n<li><strong>共享数据库是分布式单体的核心症状</strong>：目标是每个服务独占自己的数据存储。</li>\n<li><strong>拆分走三阶段路径</strong>：Schema 逻辑隔离 → 读写分离与 API 化 → 物理数据库分离，风险逐级放大但可控。</li>\n<li><strong>跨服务数据用同步策略</strong>：CDC（非侵入、低延迟）、双写（过渡期设定期限 + 一致性校验）、事件溯源（不可变事件流重放）。</li>\n<li><strong>跨服务事务用 Saga</strong>：编排式集中可控适合 3-7 步复杂流程，协同式松耦合适合 2-3 步简单流程，失败靠补偿回滚。</li>\n<li><strong>跨服务查询靠 API 组合/CQRS/数据网格</strong>：以读模型替代 SQL JOIN。</li>\n<li><strong>验证不可省略</strong>：行数、内容、时序、业务指标四维一致性校验贯穿迁移全程。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据库拆分与数据迁移","id":"数据库拆分与数据迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据层解耦的核心挑战","id":"数据层解耦的核心挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进式数据拆分路径","id":"渐进式数据拆分路径"},{"level":3,"text":"Phase 1：Schema 逻辑隔离","id":"phase-1-schema-逻辑隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"Phase 2：读写分离与 API 化","id":"phase-2-读写分离与-api-化"},{"level":3,"text":"Phase 3：物理数据库分离","id":"phase-3-物理数据库分离"},{"level":2,"text":"数据同步策略","id":"数据同步策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Change Data Capture（CDC）","id":"change-data-capture-cdc"},{"level":3,"text":"双写（Dual Write）","id":"双写-dual-write"},{"level":3,"text":"事件溯源（Event Sourcing）","id":"事件溯源-event-sourcing"},{"level":2,"text":"Saga 模式：跨服务事务","id":"saga-模式-跨服务事务"},{"level":2,"text":"跨服务查询的解决方案","id":"跨服务查询的解决方案"},{"level":2,"text":"数据迁移的验证体系","id":"数据迁移的验证体系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Monolith 到微服务迁移路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/monolith-to-microservices"},"next":{"title":"渐进式前端架构迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/frontend-migration"}}